  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HARM REDUCTION WORKS:FUND IT - World - Multicountry EECA EHRN (01-Apr-2014-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry EECA EHRN, HIV, Eurasian Harm Reduction Network (EHRN)This program has the following goals: To strengthen advocacy by civil society, including people who use drugs, for sufficient strategic and sustainable investments in harm reduction as HIV prevention in the region of Eastern Europe and Central Asia. The objectives of this program are: To build an enabling environment for sufficient, strategic and sustainable public and donors&apos; investments in harm reduction (HR)..  To develop the capacity of the community of people who use drugs to advocate for availability and sustainability of harm reduction services that meet their needs.</narrative>
  </description>
